<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>{{ report_title }}</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --color-paper: #faf9f5;
            --color-card-bg: #ffffff;
            --color-ink-primary: #1c1917;
            --color-ink-muted: #57534e;
            --color-border-subtle: #e7e5e4;
            --color-border-strong: #a8a29e;
            --color-accent: #1e3a5f;
            --color-proof-bg: #1e232a;
            --color-proof-text: #e2e8f0;
            --color-proof-cmd: #7dd3fc;
            --color-critique: #7f1d1d;
            --color-critique-bg: #fef2f2;
            --color-eleve: #9a3412;
            --color-eleve-bg: #fff7ed;
            --color-moyen: #854d0e;
            --color-moyen-bg: #fefce8;
            --color-faible: #1e40af;
            --color-faible-bg: #eff6ff;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--color-paper);
            color: var(--color-ink-primary);
            line-height: 1.35;
            font-size: 8.5pt;
            padding: 16px;
        }

        .document-wrapper {
            max-width: 840px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
            padding: 22px 26px;
        }

        header.report-header {
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        h1.report-title {
            font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
            font-size: 18pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--color-ink-primary);
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .meta-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
            gap: 4px 14px;
            font-size: 8.5pt;
            color: var(--color-ink-muted);
        }

        .meta-item strong {
            color: var(--color-ink-primary);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        h2.section-title {
            font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
            font-size: 12pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--color-accent);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
            padding-bottom: 3px;
            margin-top: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .section-intro {
            font-size: 8pt;
            color: var(--color-ink-muted);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .counts-bar {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .count-cell {
            border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
            border-top: 2.5px solid var(--color-border-strong);
            padding: 4px 8px;
            background: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .count-cell.cell-critique { border-top-color: var(--color-critique); }
        .count-cell.cell-eleve { border-top-color: var(--color-eleve); }
        .count-cell.cell-moyen { border-top-color: var(--color-moyen); }
        .count-cell.cell-faible { border-top-color: var(--color-faible); }

        .count-label {
            font-size: 7pt;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            color: var(--color-ink-muted);
        }

        .count-val {
            font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
            font-size: 14pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--color-ink-primary);
            line-height: 1.15;
        }

        table.summary-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 8pt;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        table.summary-table th,
        table.summary-table td {
            padding: 4px 6px;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
        }

        table.summary-table th {
            background-color: #f5f5f4;
            color: var(--color-ink-primary);
            font-weight: 600;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
        }

        .tag-gravity {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 7.5pt;
            padding: 1px 4px;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .tag-critique { color: var(--color-critique); background: var(--color-critique-bg); border-color: #fca5a5; }
        .tag-eleve { color: var(--color-eleve); background: var(--color-eleve-bg); border-color: #fdba74; }
        .tag-moyen { color: var(--color-moyen); background: var(--color-moyen-bg); border-color: #fde047; }
        .tag-faible { color: var(--color-faible); background: var(--color-faible-bg); border-color: #93c5fd; }

        .page-break {
            page-break-after: always;
            break-after: page;
            height: 0;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .finding-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
            margin-bottom: 9px;
            background: #ffffff;
            break-inside: avoid;
            page-break-inside: avoid;
        }

        .finding-card-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: baseline;
            padding: 5px 8px;
            background: #fbfbfb;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
        }

        .finding-card-title {
            font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
            font-size: 9.5pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--color-ink-primary);
        }

        .finding-card-title span.fid {
            color: var(--color-accent);
            margin-right: 4px;
        }

        .finding-card-body {
            padding: 6px 8px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 5px;
        }

        .impact-statement {
            font-size: 8pt;
            line-height: 1.35;
            color: var(--color-ink-primary);
        }

        .remediation-block {
            font-size: 7.8pt;
            color: var(--color-ink-muted);
        }

        .remediation-block strong {
            color: var(--color-ink-primary);
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .remediation-block ol {
            margin-left: 14px;
        }

        .remediation-block li {
            margin-bottom: 1px;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .proof-box {
            background: var(--color-proof-bg);
            color: var(--color-proof-text);
            padding: 5px 7px;
            font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
            font-size: 6.8pt;
            line-height: 1.25;
            width: 100%;
            border-left: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
            white-space: pre;
            word-break: normal;
            hyphens: none;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        .proof-cmd {
            color: var(--color-proof-cmd);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .proof-out {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            white-space: pre;
            word-break: normal;
            hyphens: none;
        }

        .prompt-block {
            background: #f5f5f4;
            border: 1px solid #d6d3d1;
            padding: 5px 7px;
            font-size: 7.6pt;
            line-height: 1.3;
            color: var(--color-ink-primary);
        }

        .prompt-title {
            font-size: 6.8pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            color: var(--color-ink-muted);
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .finding-compact {
            border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            padding: 6px 8px;
            background: #ffffff;
            break-inside: avoid;
            page-break-inside: avoid;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 4px;
        }

        .compact-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: baseline;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
            padding-bottom: 3px;
        }

        .scope-box {
            background: #fafaf9;
            border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
            padding: 8px 10px;
            font-size: 8pt;
            line-height: 1.35;
            color: var(--color-ink-muted);
            break-inside: avoid;
            page-break-inside: avoid;
        }

        .scope-box ul {
            margin-left: 16px;
            margin-top: 3px;
        }

        .scope-box li {
            margin-bottom: 1px;
        }

        footer.report-footer {
            margin-top: 14px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
            padding-top: 6px;
            font-size: 7.5pt;
            color: var(--color-ink-muted);
            text-align: center;
        }

        @media print {
            @page {
                size: A4;
                margin: 10mm 12mm;
                @bottom-right {
                    content: counter(page) " / " counter(pages);
                    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
                    font-size: 7.5pt;
                    color: #78716c;
                }
            }

            body {
                background: #ffffff;
                padding: 0;
                font-size: 8.5pt;
            }

            .document-wrapper {
                max-width: 100%;
                border: none;
                padding: 0;
            }

            .finding-card,
            .finding-compact,
            .summary-table,
            .counts-bar,
            .scope-box {
                break-inside: avoid;
                page-break-inside: avoid;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="document-wrapper">
    <header class="report-header">
        <h1 class="report-title">{{ report_title }}</h1>
        <div class="meta-grid">
            <div class="meta-item"><strong>Application :</strong> {{ application }}</div>
            <div class="meta-item"><strong>Auditeur :</strong> {{ auditor }}</div>
            <div class="meta-item"><strong>Date :</strong> {{ date }}</div>
            <div class="meta-item"><strong>Statut :</strong> {{ status_label }}</div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <h2 class="section-title">1. Synthèse des risques</h2>
    
    <div class="counts-bar">
        <div class="count-cell cell-critique">
            <div class="count-label">Critique</div>
            <div class="count-val">{{ counts.critique }}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="count-cell cell-eleve">
            <div class="count-label">Élevé</div>
            <div class="count-val">{{ counts.eleve }}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="count-cell cell-moyen">
            <div class="count-label">Moyen</div>
            <div class="count-val">{{ counts.moyen }}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="count-cell cell-faible">
            <div class="count-label">Faible</div>
            <div class="count-val">{{ counts.faible }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <table class="summary-table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="width: 10%;">Réf.</th>
                <th style="width: 44%;">Intitulé du constat</th>
                <th style="width: 13%;">Gravité</th>
                <th style="width: 18%;">Composant</th>
                <th style="width: 15%;">Outil</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for item in findings %}
            <tr>
                <td><strong>{{ item.id }}</strong></td>
                <td>{{ item.title }}</td>
                <td>
                    {% if item.gravity == 'Critique' %}
                    <span class="tag-gravity tag-critique">Critique</span>
                    {% elif item.gravity == 'Élevé' %}
                    <span class="tag-gravity tag-eleve">Élevé</span>
                    {% elif item.gravity == 'Moyen' %}
                    <span class="tag-gravity tag-moyen">Moyen</span>
                    {% else %}
                    <span class="tag-gravity tag-faible">Faible</span>
                    {% endif %}
                </td>
                <td><code>{{ item.component }}</code></td>
                <td>{{ item.tool }}</td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2 class="section-title">2. Constats détaillés et plans d'action</h2>
    <div class="section-intro">{{ prompt_intro }}</div>

    {% for item in findings %}
    {% if item.gravity in ['Critique', 'Élevé'] %}
    <div class="finding-card">
        <div class="finding-card-header">
            <div class="finding-card-title"><span class="fid">{{ item.id }}</span> : {{ item.title }}</div>
            {% if item.gravity == 'Critique' %}
            <span class="tag-gravity tag-critique">Critique</span>
            {% else %}
            <span class="tag-gravity tag-eleve">Élevé</span>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="finding-card-body">
            <div class="impact-statement">
                <strong>Impact métier :</strong> {{ item.impact }}
            </div>
            <div class="remediation-block">
                <strong>Plan de correction :</strong>
                <ol>
                    {% for step in item.remediation %}
                    <li>{{ step }}</li>
                    {% endfor %}
                </ol>
            </div>
            <div class="proof-box"><span class="proof-cmd">$ {{ item.proof_cmd }}</span>
<span class="proof-out">{{ item.proof_output }}</span></div>
            <div class="prompt-block">
                <div class="prompt-title">Prompt de correction</div>
                {{ item.prompt }}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    {% if item.id in ['SEC-01', 'SEC-04', 'SEC-07'] %}
    <div class="page-break"></div>
    {% endif %}
    {% else %}
    <div class="finding-compact">
        <div class="compact-header">
            <div class="finding-card-title"><span class="fid">{{ item.id }}</span> : {{ item.title }}</div>
            <span class="tag-gravity tag-faible">Faible</span>
        </div>
        <div class="impact-statement">
            <strong>Impact métier :</strong> {{ item.impact }}
        </div>
        <div class="remediation-block">
            <strong>Plan de correction :</strong>
            <ol>
                {% for step in item.remediation %}
                <li>{{ step }}</li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ol>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-box"><span class="proof-cmd">$ {{ item.proof_cmd }}</span>
<span class="proof-out">{{ item.proof_output }}</span></div>
        <div class="prompt-block">
            <div class="prompt-title">Prompt de correction</div>
            {{ item.prompt }}
        </div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}

    <h2 class="section-title">3. Ce qui n'a pas été testé</h2>
    <div class="scope-box">
        Conformément au cadre de l'audit express Vibe-Audit, cette mission repose exclusivement sur une revue passive et locale du code et de la configuration déclarée. Les domaines suivants sont expressément hors périmètre :
        <ul>
            {% for scope_item in untested_scope %}
            <li>{{ scope_item }}</li>
            {% endfor %}
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
